WEBVTT

NOTE
The Dollet Communication Tower interior and satellite dish activation sequence.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 13 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Inside the Communication Tower — dense pipes, scaffolding, and green-lit machinery fill the frame.

00:10.000 --> 00:20.000
Exterior of the tower: a Galbadian aircraft parked on the roof, the large dish looming above.

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
A weapons bay — rows of missiles in numbered racks inside a dark industrial chamber.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Looking up at the tower's antenna array — multiple radar dishes against a pink and purple sky.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
Camera races upward through the tower's cylindrical interior shaft, lit in blue.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
The Communication Tower's mounting arm from the side; the large dish extends outward.

01:00.000 --> 01:13.000
The satellite dish fully deployed and angled toward the sky against a glowing sunset horizon.
